+> **Branch `cursor/openxr-vr-bridge-095c`** is the `saintsrow` pin above plus one optional feature: a VR bridge (`include/rex/graphics/vr_bridge.h`). The D3D12 device can be created on an adapter a game callback names, and the Xenos plugin reports the presented guest texture and vertex-shader float constants. Nothing calls the bridge unless a game registers one, so a flat build behaves as `saintsrow`. Vigilante 8 Arcade's `--vr` path is the consumer. It is not offered upstream: the ReXGlue maintainers have asked not to receive AI-assisted pull requests.
